This repository contains or derives from third-party work:

- patches/hyperdrive/*.diff, patches/v3/*.diff: diffs against NVIDIA TensorRT-LLM 1.4.0rc1
  (https://github.com/NVIDIA/TensorRT-LLM, commit 0372799d), Apache License 2.0. Only diffs are shipped, not TRT-LLM sources.
- patches/hyperdrive/nhd_mk/fi_norm_exact.py: generated from FlashInfer 0.6.18 flashinfer/norm/kernels/fused_add_rmsnorm.py,
  Copyright (c) 2025 by FlashInfer team, Apache License 2.0 (header kept in the file).
- scripts/fetch_flashinfer_cake.sh downloads FlashInfer's CAKE Mamba-2 SSD sources (github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer,
  commit e74a167, Apache License 2.0) at image build time; they are not shipped here.
- qwen-flash-next/mods/*.py and qwen-flash-next/fancycake-48/nvfp4_csf.py: modified vLLM files (Apache License 2.0,
  SPDX headers kept), for the eugr/spark-vllm-b12x image.
- bolt-flare-voice/patches/flare-bolt-robot*/*.patch: patches against NVIDIA Flare
  (https://github.com/NVIDIA/flare-local-inference), Apache License 2.0. Only patches are shipped.
- bolt-flare-voice/patches/model-optimizer/*.patch: patches against NVIDIA Model-Optimizer, Apache License 2.0.
- correctness/data/gsm8k_test_50.jsonl: 50 problems from openai/gsm8k (MIT). correctness/data/humaneval_30.jsonl: 30 problems
  from openai/openai_humaneval (MIT). Exact revisions, indices and sha256s in correctness/data/MANIFEST.json.

